{"time": 1763610250, "type": "recv", "message_id": "248303864", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“伊恩现在还没有自己的积蓄吧？”认真地看向他，“送礼物...买东西这种事，之后再说都可以。”提起这事，伸手用力拧他腰上的软肉，“明明没什么钱，还要给舒茉买鸡血石？谢谢你嗷——”语气里带着些责怪"}
{"time": 1763610302, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1683820523", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（喜欢买是这样的，拦不住）"}
{"time": 1763610311, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1521198710", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哈哈...”不好意思的笑了笑“但是我以为舒茉很喜欢...”"}
{"time": 1763610388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "130600917", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“你都没有问过我。”翻个白眼，“都这么久了？不清楚我喜欢什么？嗯？”"}
{"time": 1763610428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2074395097", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉毕竟看了很久么，而且我也是想给你一个惊喜”"}
{"time": 1763610454, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1675951345", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（定番什么时候来）"}
{"time": 1763610539, "type": "recv", "message_id": "562116684", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“切...看那么久是我打算买给伊恩的。”站起身拍拍裙子下摆，“明明我喜欢什么颜色，早就清楚了吧？”"}
{"time": 1763610554, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2068273305", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那我缺的马鹿这块谁给我补）"}
{"time": 1763610661, "type": "recv", "message_id": "954417485", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉当时明明很开心么...”"}
{"time": 1763610687, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1335126690", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2068273305](昨天已经马鹿过了)"}
