{"time": 1763630954, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1955886212", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "退出房间，之后的事情大概不用自己操心，哼着轻快的调子，“哼哼~哼·~哼哼·”摇晃着手臂回旅馆找妈妈"}
{"time": 1763630990, "type": "recv", "message_id": "988030671", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "小步快跑跟上，同时牵住舒茉的手，十指相扣"}
{"time": 1763631014, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1717820814", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（其实与其说缺钱不如说缺个靠谱的代理）"}
