{"time": 1763698481, "type": "recv", "message_id": "694326285", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2073880170]汉斯没上床，在房间里的沙发上坐着，手上翻着一大沓报纸"}
{"time": 1763698556, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1707568077", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "想到下午做了那种事，面对叔叔阿姨有种怪怪的感觉，强忍镇定“晚上好啊，叔叔”然后去洗漱"}
{"time": 1763698559, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1281288834", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1750121385]舒蕾则靠坐在床头，手里拿着包地瓜干，咔嚓咔嚓地磨着牙"}
{"time": 1763698640, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1715772426", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=51C12C6155B31E4F5B62EA0CE6D6F8BD.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSKptiRHWMhcGof8jOdne1QkL4Cyhim4Qcg_woot8qbt7GCkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQDyaa1qGAMR_BqLTHT5lfKXoCEPWCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAMSMCImlEzkwJFJPrQKmo7hQ14QD8hZZ15KL9ZUFcExqjKS9w0vBD7mthWMVrXejl4dyQ,file_size=127142]"}
{"time": 1763698699, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1557586050", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "不知道有没有事先商量过，总之他们的第一句话都是——“回来了？下午去哪玩了？”"}
{"time": 1763698725, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1744203714", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我们去山上看了看...风景还不错”"}
{"time": 1763698826, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1964802046", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没去哪啦...去那座山上转了一下。\"犹豫了一下，凑到她身边，\"唔...妈妈下午做了什么?\"小声转移话题，尽管脸色有些不自然"}
{"time": 1763699451, "type": "recv", "message_id": "342466686", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1744203714]“喔”想来他也只是例行了解一下，没再说什么"}
{"time": 1763699557, "type": "recv", "message_id": "602350050", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1964802046]“我们和甘纳许小姐商量了下未来的打算。迈尔斯给她的钱倒是不算少……够她们在西海岸落脚了”"}
{"time": 1763699664, "type": "recv", "message_id": "727731196", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"点点脑袋，\"妈妈应该和她们谈好了吧...\"提起这件事神色舒缓下来，脑袋搭在她肩膀上，\"下午阿姨拜托我的时候...舒茉真有些不知所措...\""}
{"time": 1763699729, "type": "recv", "message_id": "924653355", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“谈好了，总归还是有点赚头”她把地瓜干递给你“她要是不主动提出来，我还不放心”"}
{"time": 1763699839, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1660169569", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "没伸手接，点点脑袋，\"嗯...想想也是...如果不是对生活还有希望的话...也不会提这种事。\"自觉张嘴，\"啊～\""}
{"time": 1763700022, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1355617244", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "自然是甜口，脆生生的声音非常抓耳。想来在车上吃起来也很方便"}
{"time": 1763700178, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2069580403", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"咽下去之后，停了一会先开口，有些扭捏，但是真的很好奇，\"妈...吻是什么感觉?\""}
{"time": 1763700321, "type": "recv", "message_id": "767815090", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（？何意）"}
{"time": 1763700339, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1136652376", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？何意）"}
{"time": 1763700490, "type": "recv", "message_id": "841618025", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(问问过来人的经验啊，毕竟刚经历过)"}
{"time": 1763700640, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2122287164", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯？”她有些惊讶，不过很快管理好表情，眯起眼睛，不知道在打量你还是在思考“嘛，好难形容……满足感？成就感？还有一丁点负罪感……？”"}
{"time": 1763700803, "type": "recv", "message_id": "444016605", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"负罪感...?\"心里哐当一声，总不能是在说自己吧，\"呃...为什么会有负罪感?妈妈当时是怎么样啦...?\""}
{"time": 1763701215, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1485284840", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“毕竟你爸爸当时算是被我拖累了嘛”她又往嘴里放了片地瓜干“虽然当时我没有说……但是内心已经认定了，他的未来只能是我的”"}
{"time": 1763701264, "type": "recv", "message_id": "775852558", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“所以我要亲手拒绝其他的可能性……抱着这样的想法，当然会有点嘛”"}
{"time": 1763701344, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1267193190", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯.\"听见妈妈这么说，心里也就安生下来，在这种事上小小地贪心一下，果然没什么问题吧?使劲点点头。"}
{"time": 1763701366, "type": "recv", "message_id": "400978465", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（下一句话问那你呢）"}
{"time": 1763701374, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1849283440", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（压 力）"}
{"time": 1763701387, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1289965254", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（那显然是，装傻）"}
{"time": 1763701463, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1391890795", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（亲了我就不能再亲别的女人了.jpg）"}
{"time": 1763701496, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1089367126", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（难道还能？）"}
{"time": 1763701519, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1471098542", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（意思是哪怕货不对板也不能退货了）"}
{"time": 1763701572, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1028868389", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好啦，怎么最近这么八卦？”她咳了咳“去洗澡吧”"}
{"time": 1763701652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "535209246", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“没什么啦，没什么。”笑嘻嘻地戳戳妈妈的脸，“舒茉只是觉得，妈妈也是这么想的话，那就太好了，不是我一个人这么觉得。”站起身，“好嘞，我去洗澡啦。”"}
{"time": 1763701654, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1821907653", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=F1E1867493CAE50C498B792F9D37712E.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQKdo6yTSKbtRqKkFzP6U2sOtQlERi56gYg_woo7pu01LyCkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQzmrmqbWAjDIBp5K1h0LXdnoCmuOCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAMSMCYBYDp3JHNcB5ufWz6W4QsmYNoyojWhtSosBtQVg-5m1oII0_griYmA_eq7u9Elyw,file_size=111929]"}
