{"time": 1763726989, "type": "recv", "message_id": "135794162", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“至少...很安静...”轻轻抱住舒茉“想和舒茉永远不分开...我们在一起吧，可以当我女朋友吗”"}
{"time": 1763727489, "type": "recv", "message_id": "931619435", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"明明上次都说了，在这种地方...\"撇撇嘴，\"好啦。\"把手心躺着的手链递出来，语气有些刻意，\"紫色的，怎么样?\""}
{"time": 1763727540, "type": "recv", "message_id": "372471983", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（妹妹说紫色）"}
