{"time": 1763729343, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1674302370", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“很漂亮...我觉得蛮适合的，所以我们这算互相交换了定情信物吧”"}
{"time": 1763729383, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1930845035", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好理所应当的所以）"}
{"time": 1763729398, "type": "recv", "message_id": "794978144", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不算。\"撇过头，翻个白眼，\"地点不对，东西也不对。\""}
{"time": 1763738743, "type": "recv", "message_id": "895145475", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？”有些失望“好吧....”"}
{"time": 1763739601, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1090333510", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"有什么失落?\"好笑地看着对方，一只手拿起胸前的蓝宝石坠子晃一晃，\"舒茉可是连初吻都给伊恩了，不过太随便啦——在这种确认的事情上必须追求一下仪式感才行。\""}
{"time": 1763739874, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1000821698", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，舒茉说的也对”重新打起精神“那为了感谢舒茉送的礼物，kiss?”"}
{"time": 1763740116, "type": "recv", "message_id": "490734630", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这为什么是感谢啦...\"有些声弱蚊蝇\"所以，昨晚到底做了什么梦?\""}
{"time": 1763746237, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1826300763", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（醒了）"}
{"time": 1763746478, "type": "recv", "message_id": "332388311", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你们不会也睡了吧）"}
{"time": 1763747229, "type": "recv", "message_id": "388188526", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(呃)"}
{"time": 1763747293, "type": "recv", "message_id": "808222882", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(睡醒了居然)"}
{"time": 1763747302, "type": "recv", "message_id": "496190601", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(做好了睡到天亮的打算)"}
{"time": 1763747402, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1715310026", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（呃）"}
{"time": 1763747452, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1757801071", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(但是醒了)"}
{"time": 1763747466, "type": "recv", "message_id": "179217378", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1826300763]（你不会又睡了吧）"}
{"time": 1763747481, "type": "recv", "message_id": "901121780", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（为通宵做准备啊）"}
{"time": 1763747495, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1544697186", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你快回)"}
{"time": 1763747535, "type": "recv", "message_id": "898612322", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=490734630]“emmm，我不想瞒舒茉什么，也不想骗舒茉..但舒茉听了可以不要生气吗..”"}
{"time": 1763747653, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1075163224", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不会生气，嘛，虽然这么说了。算了，你先讲。\""}
{"time": 1763747724, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1315446191", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“昨晚...昨晚梦到在和舒茉做很....亲密的事情，比kiss还...”"}
{"time": 1763747776, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1186731193", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"具体是什么?\"虽然有些意外，不过不至于惊讶，自己也做过海滩上的梦，升起些逗弄的心思，\"比kiss还...?\""}
{"time": 1763747855, "type": "recv", "message_id": "174803944", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（一般来说不就是本垒了）"}
{"time": 1763747874, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1089181550", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我记得翔哥描述是寸止)"}
{"time": 1763747890, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1713643316", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（起码肯定光着身子抱一起了）"}
{"time": 1763747973, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2086787686", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“就是很...”近距离看着舒茉，昨晚梦里的场景再次浮现在脑海中逐渐与眼前重合，脸瞬间红透，迅速低下了头，不敢在看舒茉“....有些..少儿不宜....”"}
{"time": 1763748106, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1678921619", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "脸红了一瞬，不过他自己低下头，反倒让自己有时间整理好仪表，\"咳咳。\"轻咳两声，\"那没有奖励咯?\""}
{"time": 1763748195, "type": "recv", "message_id": "534658403", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "听到这话努力去压制自己燥热的内心...虽然根本不可能压制“...不影响，舒茉闭上眼睛吧...”"}
{"time": 1763748328, "type": "recv", "message_id": "8737925", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不行呢～\"伸手点在对方的唇前，没有触碰，隔了一点点距离，\"在没有分清和梦里的舒茉有什么区别之前～都没有奖励了——\""}
{"time": 1763748863, "type": "recv", "message_id": "95161353", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？”用冰元素帮自己降温“好吧.....”感觉稍微好了一些，深呼吸"}
{"time": 1763748984, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1186523970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"走啦——\"手指戳戳对方的脸颊，之后满意地转过身，直接去约定好的地方坐车"}
{"time": 1763749015, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1602545837", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（调成啥了）"}
{"time": 1763749342, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1596303738", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...”牵起舒茉的手，去医疗区"}
{"time": 1763749365, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2007121797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（总之都戴上了？）"}
{"time": 1763749376, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1340108367", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(对)"}
{"time": 1763749398, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1230005353", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "蓝宝石项链挂在胸前，自然也没有隐藏的意思，倒是相当明显"}
{"time": 1763749441, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1152038405", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "医疗区，你们回来的时候，正好看到护工帮着舒蕾汉斯一起，正把莫辛和甘纳许的病床往车站方向推"}
{"time": 1763749533, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1580344487", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "有种想用冰把手链和自己彻底冻为一体的冲动...但冷静下来还是算了"}
{"time": 1763749583, "type": "recv", "message_id": "411305425", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我们也去帮忙吧。\"说完，走上前加入帮忙的行列，当然仔细确认一下莫辛的状态"}
{"time": 1763749912, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1530135147", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“回来了？”舒蕾打量着你们“还不错嘛，有些光彩照人的感觉了”\n莫辛清醒着，躺在移动的病床上有些紧张，双手扣在胸前，不过笑着朝你这边看过来"}
{"time": 1763750007, "type": "recv", "message_id": "868520739", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "笑着回了回她，\"看上去不错?\"扭头对着妈妈得意地哼哼，一直朝自己的项链点头"}
{"time": 1763750090, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1679186390", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...”也上前看看有没有什么自己可以做的，给莫辛也打个招呼“现在感觉怎么样了”"}
{"time": 1763750256, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1601964200", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "也许你可以帮着提行李，莫辛也努力朝你点点头“托恩人的福……现在可以简单下地了，不过大家都建议我还是躺着”"}
{"time": 1763750479, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1479639970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"恩人算不上啦...\"有些不好意思，\"对不起，当时还骗了你们。\""}
{"time": 1763750492, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1462982212", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“直接叫我伊恩就好了...”"}
{"time": 1763750566, "type": "recv", "message_id": "47755516", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我叫舒茉，唔，不过应该介绍过了吧？\"温和地笑"}
{"time": 1763750771, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2003339541", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我想这不算过誉的称呼……”莫辛摇摇头“非常感谢你们，我也终于有机会去往新生活了”"}
{"time": 1763750851, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1763440846", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"毕竟不能永远留在过去，嗯...让莫辛想起叔叔想让你遗忘的事...舒茉很抱歉...\"深呼吸，\"不过，我不认为是错的。\""}
{"time": 1763751182, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1415457626", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我……嗯，果然也是，我不想忘记的事情……”她的笑容收敛了些，比起高兴更像在对自己许诺“我会更坚强些的”"}
{"time": 1763751263, "type": "recv", "message_id": "397723151", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯。\"点点头，看见她这样自己也开心了一些，\"莫辛一看就是坚强的孩子。\"口吻特意变了一下"}
{"time": 1763751278, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1992993592", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...而且莫辛现在就已经很坚强了”"}
{"time": 1763751425, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1680608670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“还……差得远呢”莫辛咳了咳，扭过头去带着些歉意看甘纳许“和妈妈比起来……”"}
{"time": 1763751624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1641246026", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"阿姨毕竟是成年人嘛。\"对莫辛伸手，\"莫辛也很坚强了。\""}
{"time": 1763751630, "type": "recv", "message_id": "780792720", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "甘纳许没说什么，跨过担架握着她的手，不过明显呼吸乱了些"}
{"time": 1763751681, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2136750941", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "总之到了车站了，一架大马车停在待发处"}
{"time": 1763751761, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2103104368", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "想摸摸她，不过看她没回，先收回手。"}
{"time": 1763751778, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1912236716", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（感觉有点像翅膀）"}
{"time": 1763751838, "type": "recv", "message_id": "901019594", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1641246026]她扭回头的时候看见了你的手，愣了一下，随后把手放到你手里"}
{"time": 1763751953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1404684682", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "轻轻握住，想传递一些自己的温度给她，脸上带着盈盈笑意"}
{"time": 1763751989, "type": "recv", "message_id": "835005905", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] 你的情敌这不就来了）"}
{"time": 1763752035, "type": "recv", "message_id": "219683495", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "护工们把两个病号搬上马车，车厢里已经坐了个人了"}
{"time": 1763752073, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1577602081", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（昨天伊神不是说不可能百合么（）"}
{"time": 1763752100, "type": "recv", "message_id": "618327218", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=219683495][CQ:at,qq=825734198] 看看是谁"}
{"time": 1763752110, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2055538838", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "威黎杵着一根手杖坐在最里侧，非常心照不宣地扭头看着墙"}
{"time": 1763752257, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1396343048", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你好啊...威黎叔”"}
{"time": 1763752325, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1992540400", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯”他点了点头，又往里缩了点，给你们让位置"}
{"time": 1763752364, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2073143887", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(对舒茉也不是百合啊)"}
{"time": 1763752416, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1763054123", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "安安静静上车，\"嗯...威黎叔这是要去哪?\""}
{"time": 1763752429, "type": "recv", "message_id": "739002587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"也打算去一趟西海岸吗？\"眨眨眼"}
{"time": 1763752535, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2054210096", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这边的事忙完了，我当然是，回赫顿玛尔，也算顺路”"}
{"time": 1763752675, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2037169439", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那这趟路应该会很安全啦。\"有他在，那确实应该不用担心了，\"麻烦威黎叔了。\""}
{"time": 1763752829, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1029330821", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，到了赫顿玛尔后，去西海岸的路就得你们自己走了。我会帮你们写封信，去西海岸找卡坤就行了”"}
{"time": 1763752902, "type": "recv", "message_id": "352864519", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢威黎叔...话说那位卡坤先生是个怎样的人呢”"}
{"time": 1763752963, "type": "recv", "message_id": "334391280", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯..\"对这个问题也很感兴趣。"}
{"time": 1763753121, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1591425080", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“是个出色的刀匠、飞行驼驾驶员、冒险家、暗精灵……能力很强，也有与之相应的直脾气……或者说坏脾气”"}
{"time": 1763753278, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1516200830", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哇...头衔好多。\"一时间有些数不过来，但是暗精灵...有些不好的回忆"}
{"time": 1763753286, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2098250457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“暗精灵吗...我们之前也碰到过一个暗精灵...”"}
{"time": 1763753299, "type": "recv", "message_id": "284006844", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不好在哪）"}
{"time": 1763753436, "type": "recv", "message_id": "347755189", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不过能忍受的话，是个相当靠谱的人”"}
{"time": 1763753472, "type": "recv", "message_id": "215169547", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这样，嗯...我会加把劲相处的\""}
{"time": 1763753656, "type": "recv", "message_id": "70684278", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "坐下来，顺带也安静了下来，等待出发。"}
{"time": 1763753803, "type": "recv", "message_id": "965803928", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "行李也准备妥当。莫辛一家的行李不多，本来就不如到地方再买新的。车辆缓缓驶动，有些颠簸，但反倒令人期待"}
{"time": 1763753881, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1054755266", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"西海岸...\"想到未来的新生活，不免有些期待"}
{"time": 1763754001, "type": "recv", "message_id": "770202777", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（路上，应该，没什么事吧）"}
{"time": 1763754005, "type": "recv", "message_id": "188989121", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "未来虽然还尚不明朗，但只要舒茉在身边的话...就没有什么值得怕的了，牵住舒茉的手，然后等待..."}
{"time": 1763754222, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1569506386", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "车上的人各有各的期待。沿路在两个村庄过了夜，补充了物资，与数不清的商车和骑着马的传令兵擦身而过"}
{"time": 1763754223, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1976848889", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"握了上来的时候倒也没什么意外的，轻笑了一下，\"真是的...\"随便开口说了他一句"}
{"time": 1763754683, "type": "recv", "message_id": "637474114", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "第三日清晨，林海总算到了尽头。绕过一个山头，远景突然敞亮起来"}
{"time": 1763754861, "type": "recv", "message_id": "875870846", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“是不是快到了..”有些兴奋，车上又挤又无聊，虽然舒茉在身边，但周围还有很多人，什么都做不了"}
{"time": 1763754978, "type": "recv", "message_id": "286070557", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "当然也不会在车上做什么，大多数时间都是在自己思考自己的事情"}
{"time": 1763755709, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2031995624", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(到哪了?那个路中间的镇子?)"}
{"time": 1763755747, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1212912848", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（到赫顿玛尔了吧）"}
{"time": 1763755753, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1458782222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（路上想不出是什么活了）"}
