{"time": 1763924171, "type": "recv", "message_id": "382939574", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“是哦，舒茉穿什么码的呢...”开始估计一下"}
{"time": 1763924269, "type": "recv", "message_id": "218984551", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"咦，好像没有诶，我觉得大一点的尺寸，穿起来也很有飘飘欲仙的感觉，所以不在意啦。\"手大大方方地放在身体两侧"}
{"time": 1763924384, "type": "recv", "message_id": "567630174", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，也许咱们两个衣服尺寸差不多？”"}
{"time": 1763924418, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2114790378", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“之后自己去买啦”舒蕾揉了揉你的脑袋“之后还要穿着去学院，又不是和以前一样，走在路上也没人看你。”"}
{"time": 1763924438, "type": "recv", "message_id": "107790496", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=567630174]（虽然感觉一眼A）"}
{"time": 1763924523, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1451240966", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "眨眨眼，\"其实我比较好奇～\"收住话头，\"本身也没什么人看我吧？\""}
{"time": 1763924590, "type": "recv", "message_id": "286756338", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“总之，要社交的话，形象就是敲门砖啦”"}
{"time": 1763924622, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1306649799", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉这么漂亮，在大街上肯定很吸睛的”"}
{"time": 1763924796, "type": "recv", "message_id": "393108045", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"是吗？\"回想一下之前，\"没什么感觉诶。\"牵一下自己的衣摆，\"嘛，总之就麻烦伊恩去挑一件咯?\"侧过头对着妈妈眨眨一只眼睛。"}
{"time": 1763924808, "type": "recv", "message_id": "195653590", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我在想）"}
{"time": 1763924816, "type": "recv", "message_id": "754667664", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（难道没有更重要的东西要买吗（）"}
{"time": 1763924833, "type": "recv", "message_id": "782188502", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我不会辜负舒茉的信任的...”"}
{"time": 1763924931, "type": "recv", "message_id": "676793215", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嘛，既然这么说的话……行吧”舒蕾最后点点头。马车也终于驶完最后的路程，到了迈腾商会在赫顿玛尔的分会"}
{"time": 1763924954, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1945790747", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(有吗，感觉没有吧，该买的都买了)"}
