{"time": 1763968120, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1854589874", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2037322600]“呃...”姑且对他为什么在这里不发表评价，“这些是做什么的？”"}
{"time": 1763968747, "type": "recv", "message_id": "519595233", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“159公分，80-66-79，臂长67，腿长83……标准”她轻轻拍了拍手“都不用再拿了，就这身”"}
{"time": 1763968837, "type": "recv", "message_id": "88656500", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“行，拜托姐姐帮我包起来了，价格方面？”"}
{"time": 1763968996, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1508823128", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1854589874]“想做什么都行，装饰、敲门砖、零部件、我不知道是什么的炼金仪式……或者炖汤”他嘎嘎笑起来“我怎么知道有什么用？我只知道它很少见”"}
{"time": 1763969279, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1758492853", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“哈...”有点没听明白，“什么意思...”自己对这些东西也完全不了解..."}
{"time": 1763969446, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2012885440", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=88656500]“原价220银，小弟弟开个会员的话，9折。不过会费要10银币。也就是208咯”她轻车熟路地叠好衣服，装进纸袋里"}
{"time": 1763969492, "type": "recv", "message_id": "60625588", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我一下就买了两件，能不能再便宜点，抹个零吧...”"}
{"time": 1763969578, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1402561822", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你点话术了吗）"}
{"time": 1763969591, "type": "recv", "message_id": "599505406", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我点说服了）"}
{"time": 1763969603, "type": "recv", "message_id": "683147404", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".rd"}
{"time": 1763969603, "type": "reply", "message_id": "683147404", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[伊恩]演奏出: 1D20=17"}
{"time": 1763969647, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1901848884", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我以后肯定还会再来的，抹个零就当交朋友了，姐姐”"}
{"time": 1763969819, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1795840848", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1758492853]“不好意思，我们只是路过”舒蕾摇了摇头，尽力保持着礼貌，拉着你明显地绕开了点“舒茉，走吧”"}
{"time": 1763969968, "type": "recv", "message_id": "706634246", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1901848884]（虽然交朋友这话有点变态）"}
{"time": 1763969974, "type": "recv", "message_id": "740238296", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是你都=17了）"}
{"time": 1763969998, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1512414036", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“哦...”虽然还是有些好奇，不过既然妈妈都这么说了，乖乖跟着妈妈往后退开了些，靠到妈妈手边，小声开口，“怎么了？”"}
{"time": 1763970184, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1355342222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1901848884]“嗯……好吧？”她又有些玩味地打量起你“如果小弟弟能换上看看，再便宜些也不是不行”"}
{"time": 1763970241, "type": "recv", "message_id": "520652682", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1758492853]（我觉得问出什么意思的时候，就已经不太有买东西的可能了（））"}
{"time": 1763970284, "type": "recv", "message_id": "843286602", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(是吧，连是什么都不清楚肯定)"}
{"time": 1763970314, "type": "recv", "message_id": "152639571", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "咬咬牙“好...啊.....”非常艰难的说出二字，接过衣服视死如归的朝试衣间走去"}
{"time": 1763970467, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1888684414", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1512414036]“你不会真看上什么了吧？”舒蕾侧过头看你，余光往后面瞥了瞥“虽说确实有点稀奇……但也就是些战利品吧，找冒险家们说不定还能买到更新鲜的。而且……不觉得有点瘆得慌吗？哥布林说话什么的……”"}
{"time": 1763970486, "type": "recv", "message_id": "265081291", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好吧其实哥布林本来就会说话，但不会说这么多）"}
{"time": 1763970633, "type": "recv", "message_id": "485275348", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1888684414]\"没有啦，嗯...\"很明显缺乏这类的常识，\"哥布林不会说话吗？\"眨眨眼，\"这个...既然在城市里...应该没什么问题?\"话虽如此，还是跟着妈妈离远一些，\"但是我想看看这里过去的样子...\""}
{"time": 1763970998, "type": "recv", "message_id": "186709397", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=152639571]“咯咯……加油哦？”她在你背后轻笑着，毫不掩饰玩心。\n“试穿就能打折？怎么我来的时候就没有这种好事？”另一个更正经、和梅花一样淡雅的女声自店门口传来，接在你们的话茬后面。听不太出调笑的意思，像是认真的\n“喔，美女来了”柜员的声音却依旧轻快“不一样嘛，这种机会很难得诶”"}
{"time": 1763971113, "type": "recv", "message_id": "52293673", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（话说我看好多视频都去给男魔法师女装，尤其是冰洁）"}
{"time": 1763971214, "type": "recv", "message_id": "359130121", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=485275348]“我也没怎么见过，我很少去野外的啦”舒蕾摇头“但是就……噫，有点吓人”"}
{"time": 1763971221, "type": "recv", "message_id": "688498788", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（恐怖谷效应犯了）"}
{"time": 1763971376, "type": "recv", "message_id": "964134522", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这里以前……以前也没有什么好看的吧”又走了一阵子，舒蕾在街中间站定，顺着道路的走向“本来，应该是在这里……不过布局完全变了，街道都横过来了啊”"}
{"time": 1763971472, "type": "recv", "message_id": "966929204", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=52293673]（正太是这样的）"}
