{"time": 1763976887, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1891953470", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“姐姐再见...”虽然嘴上这么说，但希望再也不见，然后提着袋子离开"}
