{"time": 1763977272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "964191788", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=71050769]“之前不是都讲过了？嘛，你看我现在这样子像是被欺负过吗？”"}
{"time": 1763977289, "type": "recv", "message_id": "778929428", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1812017612]（哎，薄情的男人）"}
{"time": 1763977302, "type": "recv", "message_id": "667583518", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "从店里出来，感觉自己终于又可以大口大口呼吸了，太恐怖了刚刚.....不过想到舒茉到时候开心的样子，一切都是值得的...要不要再给舒茉买点什么呢？给她买点甜品好了，下来去逛甜品店了"}
{"time": 1763977500, "type": "recv", "message_id": "472968502", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=964191788]\"舒茉既然有这种能力，当然也想亲眼看看啦。\"摇摇头，眯上眼镜，\"嘛，妈妈还有什么地方想去吗？\""}
{"time": 1763977619, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1140018379", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=667583518]（恐怖在哪.jpg）"}
