{"time": 1763982101, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1862248544", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=157690246]（不是g2？）"}
{"time": 1763982232, "type": "recv", "message_id": "212818594", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“所以这个机器可以判别哪个最甜？”感觉跟想象的有点不一样，不过还是好厉害"}
{"time": 1763982308, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1546613247", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=102414515]“我没有”她摇头，一如既往地轻轻抱住你“别担心我了”"}
{"time": 1763982324, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1056051929", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这个机器人是姐姐自己做的吗”"}
{"time": 1763982366, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1670284493", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（机器）"}
{"time": 1763982501, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1008975992", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"怎么可能不担心妈妈。\"顺从地跟她一起走上回程的路，\"爸爸妈妈是舒茉最重要的人了。\""}
{"time": 1763982516, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1804462127", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(咦，如果我现在问一句，什么时候养个弟弟妹妹)"}
{"time": 1763982731, "type": "recv", "message_id": "268515280", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=212818594]“用来管理身材的”她摇头，付完款之后捏下一点碎屑，塞进小机器的一个槽口中"}
{"time": 1763982782, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1772697036", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看看接下来会发生什么"}
