{"time": 1763983561, "type": "recv", "message_id": "142911342", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1804462127]（她会告诉你再说吧）"}
{"time": 1763983573, "type": "recv", "message_id": "919741706", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（四十来岁的人了，其实有点hard）"}
{"time": 1763983651, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1663745641", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1008975992]“安心安心啦，你还不相信妈妈么？我什么都能处理好”她重新挺起胸来，像是说给自己听"}
{"time": 1763983693, "type": "recv", "message_id": "176460364", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“刚刚那个数字就是糖分吗？”有些好奇“这算高还是低”"}
{"time": 1763983825, "type": "recv", "message_id": "837640380", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这是建议摄入量”她等着店员装好袋，从头到尾都没什么表情，看着生人勿近，不过倒是不厌其烦地回答着你的问题"}
{"time": 1763983837, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2057294949", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1663745641]\"嗯嗯。\"点头如捣蒜，\"妈妈是舒茉觉得最厉害的人了。\"松了口气，笑眯眯地抱在她身上，\"妈妈什么时候给舒茉养个妹妹啦？名字我都想好咯，就叫舒芙。\""}
{"time": 1763983856, "type": "recv", "message_id": "810225521", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（舒芙是？）"}
