{"time": 1763984079, "type": "recv", "message_id": "589033991", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1068878432]（快进到舒茉看见伊恩在开心的和一个大姐姐聊天）"}
{"time": 1763984098, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1166590304", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(舒茉也不怎么妒啊)"}
{"time": 1763984104, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1627279810", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2057294949]“怎么突然想这个？也不是想想就能想出来的事。现在没有那个精力咯”"}
{"time": 1763984105, "type": "recv", "message_id": "612536032", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(只会觉得正常吧)"}
{"time": 1763984187, "type": "recv", "message_id": "774095662", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1627279810]\"唔唔，不早不晚嘛...不过，当然要等安定下来之后咯。\"松开抱着的手，换成挽着手臂，\"回去咯。\""}
{"time": 1763984258, "type": "recv", "message_id": "572924221", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对了，还没有自我介绍，我叫伊恩，刚来赫顿玛尔不久，姐姐是本地人吗”"}
{"time": 1763984310, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1048107689", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（上北下南左西右东，向上看）"}
{"time": 1763984397, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1423468019", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（话说我们在银色村庄怎么没有碰到那个女人）"}
{"time": 1763984459, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1734102838", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（青之守护者）"}
{"time": 1763984497, "type": "recv", "message_id": "30360051", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=572924221]“我来自天界”她拍拍小飞球，飞球向上抬了些，高过路上的行人和遮阳伞“自己做的，你要买吗？”"}
{"time": 1763984505, "type": "recv", "message_id": "814358392", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1734102838]（因为没必要）"}
{"time": 1763984591, "type": "recv", "message_id": "588760427", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“天界？天上？那姐姐岂不是神仙么”"}
{"time": 1763984710, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1781988993", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不是，你不知道天界。”她迈动步子，沿着街道走“也正常，不总是联通的”"}
{"time": 1763984773, "type": "recv", "message_id": "949534033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...我是从小地方来的，很多地方确实不太清楚”"}
{"time": 1763984863, "type": "recv", "message_id": "626587762", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦。总之只是个地方”她没有进一步解释的意思"}
{"time": 1763984888, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1659310433", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那个机器人看起来确实很神奇，忽然想到了之前碰到的玲玲，如果她看见了，肯定会更兴奋吧，至于买的话，自己虽然很感兴趣，但直言不讳的说道“这样啊，不过这个机器人看起来这么厉害，我应该买不起”"}
{"time": 1763985008, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1547660561", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我感觉魔界科技和天界科技）"}
{"time": 1763985016, "type": "recv", "message_id": "685124611", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好吧，顶端用法还是有点区别的）"}
{"time": 1763985424, "type": "recv", "message_id": "358354008", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“一般”她不咸不淡地回应“成本也就三四个金币”"}
{"time": 1763985479, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2024688885", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对于现在的我也算是天文数字了。。。。”"}
{"time": 1763985526, "type": "recv", "message_id": "28360717", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不聊这些了，所以姐姐在赫顿玛尔待多久了”"}
{"time": 1763986413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1717003332", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“三四年了。问这个做什么？”她总算是问了自己的问题"}
{"time": 1763986448, "type": "recv", "message_id": "127803870", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“想问问姐姐赫顿玛尔有没有什么推荐去的地方”"}
{"time": 1763986673, "type": "recv", "message_id": "99301844", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那你应该问紫苑，我不太逛街”她想了想，补充到“就是刚刚那个店员”"}
{"time": 1763986759, "type": "recv", "message_id": "36103656", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“.....”原来自己早就被认出来了，刚刚的事情重新浮现在脑海里，感觉想找个地洞钻进去“抱歉，姐姐，我忽然想起来我还有事，先走了 再见👋🏻”转身逃跑似的离开了"}
{"time": 1763987419, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1130040773", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你们会个面吧那就）"}
{"time": 1763990628, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2037618560", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=36103656](在哪会面)"}
{"time": 1763990652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "519214527", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（哇嘎呐）"}
{"time": 1763992977, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1952886474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（那我觉得还是等龙神说在哪见面吧）"}
{"time": 1763993372, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2116556261", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（没区别吧）"}
{"time": 1763994151, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2128569304", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "街角瞥见跑起来的伊恩，有些奇怪，\"诶诶?伊恩!\"大声喊他一句"}
{"time": 1763994262, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1806511086", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "听到舒茉的声音，停了下来，想要装作什么都没发生的样子....硬着头皮过去了“好巧啊...舒茉”"}
{"time": 1763994767, "type": "recv", "message_id": "991108422", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1806511086]\"嗯..?\"看着他提着大包小包跑路，\"伊恩干嘛在这跑起来了?发生什么了？\""}
{"time": 1763995006, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1076727905", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，我感觉时间不早了，得快点回去...”"}
{"time": 1763995086, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1866617185", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "女装这种事情...这辈子都不想让舒茉知道“对了，不提这个了，我给大家买了甜品，舒茉和阿姨尝尝吧”"}
{"time": 1763995253, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2025127730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不对～\"歪头看着她，\"嗯?发生了什么好事吗？\"意味深长"}
{"time": 1763995292, "type": "recv", "message_id": "588030354", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没有啦..什么都没有发生”连忙否认"}
{"time": 1763995360, "type": "recv", "message_id": "211936516", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "靠近一些，眼神变得稍微有些锐利，\"嗯?不老实交代的话——舒茉可不保证会发生什么。\""}
{"time": 1763995440, "type": "recv", "message_id": "240670245", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“...发生了很羞耻的事情...我不想说...”求饶的看着舒茉"}
{"time": 1763995649, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1482813134", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"看一眼妈妈，靠近一点小声对伊恩开口，\"待会告诉我?\""}
{"time": 1763995901, "type": "recv", "message_id": "651590529", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "坚定的摇摇头“只有这件事...绝对不可以....”"}
{"time": 1763996026, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1657835870", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"伊恩?\"轻轻咳了两声，\"刚刚离开舒茉一会，就有了不能告诉舒茉的事?\"说这话的时候语气平静"}
{"time": 1763996062, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1093724453", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我....好吧好吧...我说了舒茉别嘲笑我....”"}
{"time": 1763996169, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1678601160", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不想说也可以不说呢——\""}
{"time": 1763996217, "type": "recv", "message_id": "170826941", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看了眼舒蕾然后凑到舒茉耳边非常小声的说到"}
{"time": 1763996326, "type": "recv", "message_id": "27397081", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“刚刚....我去帮舒茉买衣服的时候，老板说...我试穿的话.....可以....打折，然后事后我去找人打听事情,被认出来了.....”越说感觉越羞耻，自己怎么会做出这样的事，想找块豆腐撞死"}
{"time": 1763996710, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1867211513", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=27397081]\"试穿?\"笑容逐渐充盈在脸上，\"那，这套衣服就送给伊恩了吧。\""}
{"time": 1763996795, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2020065388", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不要....都说是给舒茉买的，舒茉自己穿吧。。。”"}
{"time": 1763996869, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1993400305", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "想把两套衣服强硬的塞舒茉手里，但感觉她估计会累，还是自己再拿会吧，女装什么的，这辈子都不可能第二次了...."}
{"time": 1763997065, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1960107335", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"干什么～既然伊恩都穿过了，再给我吗?\"笑容盈盈挂在脸颊上，\"我也想看诶\""}
{"time": 1763997094, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1405995874", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“洗一下就好了.. 新买的衣服本来就得洗...”"}
{"time": 1763997319, "type": "recv", "message_id": "663718360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯哼?\"不接衣服"}
{"time": 1763997388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1859699783", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "暂时先帮舒茉提着袋子“好了，我们先回去吧....舒茉就当什么都没听见就好了”"}
{"time": 1763997687, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1225672431", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=1252219916][CQ:at,qq=825734198] 1？ ）"}
{"time": 1763997702, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1907048651", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不1）"}
{"time": 1763997706, "type": "recv", "message_id": "705005354", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（今晚有个ddl）"}
{"time": 1763997785, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1562724225", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1806511086]（好巧啊是什么话术）"}
{"time": 1763997869, "type": "recv", "message_id": "10813360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1859699783]\"不行～这件事要谈好呢——\"依然笑眯眯地"}
{"time": 1763997875, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1047383972", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"伊恩回去穿给我看?\""}
{"time": 1763997893, "type": "recv", "message_id": "234612257", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1867211513]（感觉是阿尼娅同款）"}
{"time": 1763998004, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1025185685", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "舒蕾看你们两个自己在聊，注意力没放在你们的聊天内容上"}
{"time": 1763998018, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1450808672", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不可以....而且...回去也没什么独处的时间和空间...”"}
{"time": 1763998052, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1280865968", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "试图讲道理"}
{"time": 1763998186, "type": "recv", "message_id": "702340777", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不行呢～\""}
{"time": 1763998265, "type": "recv", "message_id": "170749262", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "摆出不听不听的架势摇头，\"为什么她们看得了，我不能看?\""}
{"time": 1763998397, "type": "recv", "message_id": "554140546", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“因为我和她们不可能再见面了.....而且我绝对不想在叔叔或者阿姨面前....”"}
{"time": 1763998661, "type": "recv", "message_id": "422509406", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...唔唔，我不能看?\""}
{"time": 1763998766, "type": "recv", "message_id": "695991964", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉实在想看的话.....”深吸一口气，无奈的说道“首先那身衣服舒茉要自己收着..不要送给我，其次我们得找个没有其他人的地方.....”"}
{"time": 1763999494, "type": "recv", "message_id": "637254846", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"为什么不给你?\""}
{"time": 1763999532, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2061261162", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我不想要...舒茉收着吧”"}
{"time": 1763999944, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1280786559", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"当做舒茉送给伊恩的礼物啦，好不好。\"笑容一直挂在嘴角，这可是难得有趣的大事。"}
{"time": 1763999976, "type": "recv", "message_id": "803928876", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我不想要这种礼物...”欲哭无泪"}
{"time": 1764000462, "type": "recv", "message_id": "821588652", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"干什么嘛——回去回去，穿给我看看。\""}
{"time": 1764000642, "type": "recv", "message_id": "402819023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好吧，但你想办法把阿姨给支开....”不想再被更多的人知道了"}
{"time": 1764000709, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1345718670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯哼?\"回头拉着妈妈，\"妈妈，在看什么?回去啦\""}
{"time": 1764000896, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1866815494", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=402819023]\"我觉得妈妈也该看看。\"低下头小声对伊恩说话"}
{"time": 1764001141, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2707198", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不行...感觉会给阿姨留下不好的印象....”"}
{"time": 1764002013, "type": "recv", "message_id": "584610015", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2707198]\"诶～妈妈估计会很开心吧？\"笑着摸摸伊恩的脑袋，\"怎么了？\""}
{"time": 1764002059, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1523448650", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这样...很不沉稳...”"}
{"time": 1764002517, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1239768567", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶?可是你在人前都做过了诶。\""}
{"time": 1764002568, "type": "recv", "message_id": "703296202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"现在还怕吗？\"继续调侃，语气带着些藏不住的笑"}
{"time": 1764002580, "type": "recv", "message_id": "25818985", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“她们又不认识我....”"}
{"time": 1764002631, "type": "recv", "message_id": "665544763", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不认识，就可以?\"挑了挑眉毛，\"不认识，伊恩可以随便她们玩弄了？\""}
{"time": 1764002804, "type": "recv", "message_id": "301670650", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不是这个道理啦....”"}
{"time": 1764002911, "type": "recv", "message_id": "813873549", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“而且.. 我只是想省点钱....”"}
{"time": 1764003078, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1252336606", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=813873549]\"还不是?哼哼，甚至为了一点钱?\"一根手指戳着伊恩的胸口，\"为了钱诶。\""}
{"time": 1764003179, "type": "recv", "message_id": "864721479", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“省下的钱可以给舒茉买点其他东西哎...我还单独给舒茉买了个蛋糕，希望你会喜欢”"}
{"time": 1764003472, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1652341019", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不改变性质啊？\"抖抖眉毛，\"你这不还是，出卖了自己。\"哼了一声"}
{"time": 1764003659, "type": "recv", "message_id": "809839774", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“....所以更不能让阿姨知道了....”"}
{"time": 1764003820, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1552283851", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（人家就在旁边啊）"}
{"time": 1764003845, "type": "recv", "message_id": "862418928", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（小声说话这一块）"}
{"time": 1764003947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1372717950", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哼。\"看看妈妈，\"妈——\"拖长音，看看她有没有在听"}
{"time": 1764004053, "type": "recv", "message_id": "27954797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "有种想要紫砂的冲动..."}
{"time": 1764004542, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2052157973", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "深吸一口气“...行吧，反正已经这样了，再多几个人我也无所谓了...”"}
{"time": 1764005041, "type": "recv", "message_id": "541348024", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"咦?不行。\"伸手握住他的手，\"只能给我看。\""}
{"time": 1764005319, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2114331937", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"懂了吗？只能给我。哼\""}
{"time": 1764005471, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1567165185", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯.....”乖乖点点头"}
{"time": 1764005545, "type": "recv", "message_id": "879231794", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你动)"}
{"time": 1764005674, "type": "recv", "message_id": "368855071", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那我们快回去吧...”手上东西有点多，虽然想牵手，但是做不到"}
{"time": 1764005760, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1409327441", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "帮伊恩接过一些零食，\"走吧。\""}
{"time": 1764005770, "type": "recv", "message_id": "163927590", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1372717950]“啊，什么？发生什么了？”"}
{"time": 1764005980, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1321501971", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“哼..妈妈刚刚又在做什么？”伸手掐一把她的腰，“根本没在听人家讲话。”"}
{"time": 1764005993, "type": "recv", "message_id": "370868619", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“多谢舒茉了”牵起她的手"}
{"time": 1764006180, "type": "recv", "message_id": "366323825", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哎好痒……”舒蕾躲开了你的手“我在想，舒茉的性格，进了学院会不会吃亏……”"}
{"time": 1764006301, "type": "recv", "message_id": "568513486", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？会吗，感觉舒茉人很好啊”"}
{"time": 1764006327, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1792815621", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那你也沾点m在的）"}
{"time": 1764006341, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1391640773", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我还能说不好吗）"}
{"time": 1764006352, "type": "recv", "message_id": "621440306", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（能啊）"}
{"time": 1764006358, "type": "recv", "message_id": "418171109", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我敢说小龙女）"}
{"time": 1764006464, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1880992943", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶?为什么?\"没想到妈妈会说这种话，\"吃亏?\"歪着脑袋，\"为什么。\""}
{"time": 1764006653, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1631065630", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=418171109]（那你也不能当着小龙女她爹面前说吧（）"}
{"time": 1764006661, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1896660692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（确实说过）"}
{"time": 1764006666, "type": "recv", "message_id": "680826634", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（说她开车烂）"}
{"time": 1764006724, "type": "recv", "message_id": "388536897", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好像没什么问题)"}
{"time": 1764006856, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1576290742", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1880992943]“嗯……怎么说呢，毕竟……不是所有人都会和我们一样？”舒蕾简单解释了一下"}
{"time": 1764007059, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1646880139", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“到了学院我也会陪着舒茉，阿姨不用太担心啦”"}
{"time": 1764007094, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1266197463", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...诶...\"大概知道了母亲的意思，\"嗯...舒茉要怎么改?\""}
{"time": 1764007204, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1036949070", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“问我们问不出来啦”她有些为难“已经……觉得怎么都很正常了”"}
{"time": 1764007377, "type": "recv", "message_id": "47990823", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好啦好啦。\"耸耸肩，\"那就以后再说，回去吧!\"朝伊恩眨眨眼，衣服地事情可不能忘了。"}
{"time": 1764007415, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2143353510", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "捏一下舒茉的手，表示自己还记得.."}
{"time": 1764007526, "type": "recv", "message_id": "540941927", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "总之，back"}
{"time": 1764007533, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1899438733", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "任着伊恩捏手，想到待会的事情，现在心情大好。"}
{"time": 1764007672, "type": "recv", "message_id": "416286750", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "莫辛和甘纳许已经在房间里静养了。汉斯不在，大概是去找教会了"}
{"time": 1764007739, "type": "recv", "message_id": "443759327", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "当然不打算打扰母女两静养，朝着伊恩招招手，和母亲打个招呼到没人的小房间里。"}
{"time": 1764007809, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1168866248", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "事已至此，既然是舒茉的请求，反正已经有了第一次,第二次应该也没那么不能接受...跟着舒茉"}
{"time": 1764007864, "type": "recv", "message_id": "728907580", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=443759327]“干什么？神神秘秘的……”她有些狐疑，尤其是看到你们唯独没放下衣服的时候"}
{"time": 1764007913, "type": "recv", "message_id": "827380084", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯哼～～\"对着母亲神秘地笑一笑，\"没事啦——\"拖长音，\"妈妈好好休息哦。\"拿出伊恩买的甜点递给妈妈"}
{"time": 1764007916, "type": "recv", "message_id": "516203532", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "把吃的给大家留下来“为大家买的甜品，都尝尝吧，很好吃的...”"}
{"time": 1764008005, "type": "recv", "message_id": "593347710", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，孤男寡女共处一室）"}
{"time": 1764008258, "type": "recv", "message_id": "363531916", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好啦，妈妈休息一下。我马上就出来。\""}
{"time": 1764008288, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1859030902", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“谢谢……”发给莫辛的时候，她的视线明显亮了些，她回头看了眼母亲，随后双手接过你的甜点“这些……嗯，我们会记住的”"}
{"time": 1764008336, "type": "recv", "message_id": "760500026", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（就差发好人卡了）"}
{"time": 1764008398, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1035063259", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯～\"点点头，\"莫辛要多吃一些呢，有助于养伤。\"小心地避开伤口摸摸她的脑袋，\"明天记得跟着我们去找牧师哦～\""}
{"time": 1764008493, "type": "recv", "message_id": "682449911", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没关系啦，而且我们是朋友对吧”"}
{"time": 1764008601, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1843477592", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不，有关系的”她坚持地摇头“如果不记住这些……大家都会生气的。哥哥姐姐叔叔阿姨都是很好的人”"}
{"time": 1764008729, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1511729686", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我们年龄差不多啦，莫辛直接叫我伊恩就好了”"}
{"time": 1764008730, "type": "recv", "message_id": "658604355", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "眼睛弯得像是两轮月牙，嘴角不自觉勾起，这样的话，就不用担心莫辛的心理问题了。点点脑袋，\"嘛，这样也挺好啦。记住是一回事，不过要好好养伤，早一点好起来啦。\""}
{"time": 1764008824, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1681616748", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"而且...\"自己倒是想被叫姐姐，这么想着，\"哼哼，有事就记得找姐姐。\""}
{"time": 1764008833, "type": "recv", "message_id": "785626141", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯嗯”她点头，抱着蛋糕走回床沿，看起来她能下地的时间还有限"}
{"time": 1764008932, "type": "recv", "message_id": "50444886", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "帮着她重新坐回床上，盖好被子。然后扭头看向伊恩，\"嗯——?怎么还在这?\""}
{"time": 1764009066, "type": "recv", "message_id": "979970889", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好吧好吧...我这就去...”去那个没人的小房间，先换着衣服，依旧是之前穿过的那套"}
{"time": 1764009078, "type": "recv", "message_id": "860570092", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "第二次穿倒是熟练了不少..."}
{"time": 1764009159, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1134330988", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(扣上裙子?穿好丝袜?)"}
{"time": 1764009206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1705378225", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（应该没有丝袜（）"}
{"time": 1764009211, "type": "recv", "message_id": "639248", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（可能得你提供了）"}
{"time": 1764009286, "type": "recv", "message_id": "24998210", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "和上次一般的贴身，毕竟完全按着你的身材提供的——说不定比舒茉穿着还合身，难怪别人都想让你穿上看看"}
{"time": 1764009377, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1024719790", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "安顿好莫辛，帮她收拾一下蛋糕的残渣，等伊恩的动静"}
{"time": 1764009523, "type": "recv", "message_id": "235355297", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（一切的起因是，你走进了一家女装店，然后让人家按你的尺码给）"}
{"time": 1764009585, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1720478626", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（一切的起因是，你走进了一家女装店，然后让人家按你的尺码给）"}
{"time": 1764009608, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1421618221", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "稍微开一个门缝...朝舒茉挥挥手"}
{"time": 1764009649, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1084687957", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "伊恩好慢...这么想着看见他推开了门，\"嗯..\"深呼吸，小心地拿纸巾擦干莫辛的嘴边，\"莫辛好好休息哦。\"起身去房间里看看"}
{"time": 1764009729, "type": "recv", "message_id": "325538877", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（所以你们一直在她们房间里干这干那吗（）"}
{"time": 1764009749, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1869106338", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不知道啊）"}
{"time": 1764009752, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1427300156", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"很合身啊——\"关上门定睛打量，一眼看出尺码有些不同，\"意外合适?要不伊恩当我妹妹好了。\"拉拉他的衣袖和裙摆"}
{"time": 1764009759, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1008538288", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我也不清楚构造....）"}
{"time": 1764009761, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1908333501", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我以为是一个大房间)"}
{"time": 1764009771, "type": "recv", "message_id": "396263056", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（当然不是（）"}
{"time": 1764009777, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1038708674", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（标准套间）"}
{"time": 1764009779, "type": "recv", "message_id": "109364494", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不太想说话，甚至不太想抬头..."}
{"time": 1764009782, "type": "recv", "message_id": "595974727", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好的。)"}
{"time": 1764009796, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1321014794", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是汉斯出去了，所以确实有个房间没人）"}
{"time": 1764009817, "type": "recv", "message_id": "681327043", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "伸手帮他抚平衣服上的褶皱，牵平裙角，笑，\"嗯哼?要不以后就这么穿?\""}
{"time": 1764009898, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1691482224", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“要是舒茉喜欢的话.....”"}
{"time": 1764009911, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1632522738", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那也不行”摇摇头"}
{"time": 1764009986, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1908765942", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "这衣服自己穿可能还没有这么合身，伸手量了量肩宽，\"我倒也没那方面的兴趣...\"收回手，\"不过，这两件要不送给伊恩了?\""}
{"time": 1764010028, "type": "recv", "message_id": "311184668", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "随意地拿起一盒甜点，靠着桌子，一边拿勺子慢慢品尝一边开口调笑"}
{"time": 1764010244, "type": "recv", "message_id": "597960701", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不要.. 都说是给舒茉买的了...而且舒茉不是说要稍微宽松一点么，我觉得正合适...”起身去把房门反锁一下"}
{"time": 1764010327, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1320857276", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...干什么...\"没想到伊恩会突然锁门，整个人愣了一下，\"这里不行...\""}
{"time": 1764010455, "type": "recv", "message_id": "349097795", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我们已经好几天没独处过了...”虽然现在穿着不是很方便就是了"}
{"time": 1764010628, "type": "recv", "message_id": "126648313", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉不想吗....kiss”"}
{"time": 1764010659, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2017423092", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"妈妈还在外面...\"语气都小了很多，握着勺子的手有些抖，整个人一下气势全无。"}
{"time": 1764010885, "type": "recv", "message_id": "777282756", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“阿姨应该发现不了吧...算了，舒茉不想的话...就算kiss了，也不会开心....”"}
{"time": 1764010931, "type": "recv", "message_id": "507771055", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那我就先去把衣服换回去了...我不会要这两套衣服的....舒茉留着吧”"}
{"time": 1764010977, "type": "recv", "message_id": "171340831", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(有点背德)"}
{"time": 1764011057, "type": "recv", "message_id": "945093611", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"手指绞在一起，脸色潮红，不敢看他，而是扭头看着外面，\"可以...吻...但是，衣服要留着，最起码一件...\""}
{"time": 1764011197, "type": "recv", "message_id": "193271541", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看她这个样子，忍不住逗她一下，嘴角微微上扬，至于女装，已经稍微习惯了一些“那舒茉想要我正穿着的这套，还是没穿过的那套”"}
{"time": 1764011409, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1626590024", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那还用说...\"依然不敢正眼看，低着脑袋看脚尖，整个人有些发抖，随即脚下一软坐在了椅子上。"}
{"time": 1764011520, "type": "recv", "message_id": "192987745", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“如果换位思考我是舒茉的话，我会选择伊恩现在穿的这套，这样以后就有看伊恩穿另一套的机会了，舒茉是这么想的吗..”故意说道"}
{"time": 1764011883, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1139664147", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这..这..这样的吗？\"感觉有蒸汽从脑门发出，\"舒...舒茉不知道...\"一只手捂着额头抓着碎发，另一只捂着眼睛，\"不知道...啊...不是...\""}
{"time": 1764012040, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2087974014", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不过这个问题舒茉可以慢慢想，时间还有很多...现在的话”"}
{"time": 1764012074, "type": "recv", "message_id": "260067009", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "用手轻轻托起舒茉的下巴，然后吻去"}
{"time": 1764012198, "type": "recv", "message_id": "899299070", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔...唔唔...\"本来还打算说什么的声音变成了喘息的呢喃，未曾褪下大脑的燥热随即传遍全身，但是颤抖去逐渐停了下来，随着思考一起，一片空白。"}
{"time": 1764012345, "type": "recv", "message_id": "918101372", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "上次kiss感觉似乎已经好久以前的事情了....感觉已经很久没有和舒茉有这种亲密的机会，很快便完全沉浸了，脑海里除了舒茉什么也没有了....."}
{"time": 1764012461, "type": "recv", "message_id": "675783143", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我没接过吻....伸舌头是进阶玩法还是基础玩法（）"}
{"time": 1764012465, "type": "recv", "message_id": "339050509", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(睡，明天早起)"}
{"time": 1764012485, "type": "recv", "message_id": "124244865", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=675783143](舌吻一般刚开始接吻的人不习惯)"}
{"time": 1764012495, "type": "recv", "message_id": "288215048", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(其实我一直不喜欢舌吻)"}
{"time": 1764012543, "type": "recv", "message_id": "148322595", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那你要🐍吗)"}
{"time": 1764012557, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1782859308", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不知道，可以试试）"}
{"time": 1764012653, "type": "recv", "message_id": "905812991", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(只要你能描写好触感的话)"}
{"time": 1764032803, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1357776916", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（诶，我终于想到既视感了）"}
{"time": 1764032808, "type": "recv", "message_id": "100033680", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（有点像）"}
{"time": 1764032811, "type": "recv", "message_id": "748136776", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（唐三）"}
{"time": 1764032819, "type": "recv", "message_id": "336713274", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（武魂殿和昊天宗都要踢一轮）"}
{"time": 1764032840, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1791746810", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(谁)"}
{"time": 1764032853, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1576901882", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你啊（）"}
{"time": 1764032999, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2081066586", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（先锤开赌场的，再锤开道场的）"}
{"time": 1764033110, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1613554129", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(呃呃)"}
{"time": 1764033148, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1756829421", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(只能说不太一样，形式不同)"}
{"time": 1764033154, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2044943718", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(只能说不太一样，性质不同)"}
{"time": 1764033170, "type": "recv", "message_id": "970635306", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(但是你睡个觉攻守之势异也 有什么头绪吗"}
{"time": 1764033175, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1146151545", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不同在哪）"}
{"time": 1764033206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1555413254", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（没有，但是我会说蛇吻的心理因素大于感官）"}
