{"time": 1764045094, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1008268937", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=570106136]汉斯没说话，只是把手伸给你"}
