{"time": 1764045370, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1318841838", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=693674371]不到两分钟，你却感觉度秒如年，自己身上发过了一轮汗，终于，帘子被撩开，一位衣着清凉、穿着侧身开衩的马面裙的短发女性从里面走出来"}
{"time": 1764045394, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1914242406", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1119757549]自然是，去了舒蕾的房间"}
