{"time": 1764056439, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2095662764", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "空气中飘着微妙的香味，总之你很快换好了衣服，又变回平平无奇的样子"}
