{"time": 1764056806, "type": "recv", "message_id": "99728620", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "舒茉肯定对我很失望吧....."}
{"time": 1764056873, "type": "recv", "message_id": "361529388", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "想要逃跑....不行，这样会有很多麻烦，深吸一口气，算了，还是回去吧....无精打采的朝着旅馆走去"}
{"time": 1764057007, "type": "recv", "message_id": "96068538", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1914242406]如果你不打算开门……门倒是也很容易就能敲开。舒蕾时隔不到10分钟再次见到你“呃？怎么了这是？”"}
