{"time": 1764059300, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1144393498", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=96068538]当然没有开口的意愿，不看她"}
{"time": 1764059377, "type": "recv", "message_id": "93951798", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“舒茉？”她伸手在你眼前晃晃“怎么了？这是……受欺负了？”"}
{"time": 1764059577, "type": "recv", "message_id": "709391930", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没...只是有点不舒服。\"干脆继续父亲的看法，\"嗯...\""}
{"time": 1764059687, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1172896328", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“刚才还好好的呢……？哪不舒服？要不要去找医生？”"}
{"time": 1764059738, "type": "recv", "message_id": "950441527", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"休息一下...头有点晕，休息一下就好了。\""}
{"time": 1764059903, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1147282253", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……”舒蕾把你抱到床上“可能有点晕马车，坐太久了……休息会吧，午饭想吃什么？”"}
{"time": 1764060196, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1700134966", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=361529388]“诶~？这是喜欢这身衣服还是不喜欢？”你走到店门口的时候，紫苑把下巴撑在桌子上，随口问了你一句"}
{"time": 1764060431, "type": "recv", "message_id": "897886052", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我觉得穿女装还能kiss起来完全是本子剧情）"}
{"time": 1764060447, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1401102833", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（还是小马拉大车）"}
{"time": 1764060549, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1605471775", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1147282253]\"不知道...\"完全没想过，\"妈妈带点吧...不想吃荤。\""}
{"time": 1764060717, "type": "recv", "message_id": "940672024", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] 人呢又）"}
{"time": 1764060766, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1930060576", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我比伊恩还矮一点吧，什么叫小马)"}
{"time": 1764061028, "type": "recv", "message_id": "654568158", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我说本子剧情）"}
{"time": 1764061069, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1375498764", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那还真是)"}
{"time": 1764061096, "type": "recv", "message_id": "199959065", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1605471775]“嗯，赫顿玛尔的吃的可多……对了，伊恩呢？刚刚不是还和你在一块？”"}
{"time": 1764061328, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2072760488", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"他...\"提起他没来由一阵心慌，幸好自己可以把脸盖住，\"他出去了，要买东西吧...\"声音很小"}
{"time": 1764061398, "type": "recv", "message_id": "406865015", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] ）"}
{"time": 1764061403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "126947465", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（要不你给他打个电话吧）"}
