{"time": 1764061560, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1511087047", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那我打个看看)"}
{"time": 1764061804, "type": "recv", "message_id": "692316496", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(没接，我感觉睡着了)"}
{"time": 1764061854, "type": "recv", "message_id": "82111560", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，怎么又睡）"}
{"time": 1764062118, "type": "recv", "message_id": "804595334", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2072760488]“嗯……”舒蕾见状也没有多说，伸了个懒腰，骨骼发出轻微的咔吧声“那我就，去买午饭咯？舒茉休息会”"}
{"time": 1764062190, "type": "recv", "message_id": "452022545", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"听见妈妈这么说简直如蒙大赦，原本有些紧绷的身体舒展了一些，\"嗯...\"不知道伊恩那边情况怎么样..."}
{"time": 1764062453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "214717693", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "汉斯和舒蕾先后离开了，房间里很快只剩你一个人"}
{"time": 1764062997, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1327626306", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "伸手摸了摸自己的嘴唇，刚刚被环抱的触感记忆犹新，虽然燥热在逐渐平息，但想起被锢在怀中的感觉，身体还是不免有些热意，一个人躺在床上也难以完全压制。用被子把自己死死裹住，整个人藏进被子里。"}
