{"time": 1764069930, "type": "recv", "message_id": "903740505", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "反正也没什么事情做，慢慢等吧"}
{"time": 1764069945, "type": "recv", "message_id": "519362332", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（站着等有点神）"}
{"time": 1764069950, "type": "recv", "message_id": "596063453", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（虽然我也干过）"}
{"time": 1764069958, "type": "recv", "message_id": "34076449", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（回宿舍忘了带钥匙）"}
{"time": 1764069974, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1152757456", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(正常，我也干过)"}
{"time": 1764069983, "type": "recv", "message_id": "67196938", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(微信发消息问室友人去哪了)"}
{"time": 1764070041, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1609141695", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "只剩下些头发留在被子外面，迷迷糊糊，再加上被子里循环很慢的热气，本就不清醒的大脑，很快又睡了过去"}
{"time": 1764070244, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1986326108", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "一静下来，脑子又全是刚刚女装狂奔的场面.....不是我，不是我，不是我....不断的催眠自己"}
{"time": 1764070251, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1971557316", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你大概在门口站了二十分钟，舒蕾才终于从走廊尽头的升降梯出来，手里拎着两个大袋子“嗯？伊恩，刚好，帮我拿一下”"}
{"time": 1764070290, "type": "recv", "message_id": "990025638", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哦哦。。。”思考忽然被打断，呆呆的接过了袋子"}
{"time": 1764070310, "type": "recv", "message_id": "239289361", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉没有和阿姨一起吗”"}
{"time": 1764070452, "type": "recv", "message_id": "41986735", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“她有点不舒服，估计睡了”舒蕾用空出的手摸出房间钥匙，利落地开了门。你拿着的那个袋子里飘出玉米排骨汤和荠菜饺子的香气"}
{"time": 1764070456, "type": "recv", "message_id": "910911547", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（是不是太中式了）"}
{"time": 1764070475, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1816359507", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是我感觉赫顿玛尔的文化圈很乖，找不到什么原型）"}
{"time": 1764070481, "type": "recv", "message_id": "619375279", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是我感觉赫顿玛尔的文化圈很怪，找不到什么原型）"}
{"time": 1764070498, "type": "recv", "message_id": "582770086", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哦哦，这样啊...”"}
{"time": 1764070499, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1900918232", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（除了建筑风格有点偏中东）"}
{"time": 1764070519, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1165232192", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是除了面包不知道吃啥了）"}
{"time": 1764070520, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1013801344", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(法国？)"}
{"time": 1764070539, "type": "recv", "message_id": "891582073", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（真是法国就好了）"}
{"time": 1764070552, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1048045813", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(真是法国就吃法餐了)"}
{"time": 1764070572, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1287390566", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（感觉公国和帝国就有一种法国和德国的既视感吧（）"}
{"time": 1764070667, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1295836537", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（嘿鬼多这块确实有点法吧）"}
{"time": 1764070722, "type": "recv", "message_id": "889343242", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是没有别的符合刻板印象的了）"}
{"time": 1764070879, "type": "recv", "message_id": "811598907", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（非要说，我觉得领导人是女王这点其实比较像带英）"}
{"time": 1764070931, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1903964702", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我去百度搜，说赫顿玛尔原型是欧洲，魔界是美国，虚祖是湖南，天界是比利时，格兰之森是挪威）"}
{"time": 1764070960, "type": "recv", "message_id": "856177318", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（去虚祖就可以吃辣椒炒肉了）"}
{"time": 1764070980, "type": "recv", "message_id": "505479503", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=582770086]总之推开门，舒蕾把袋子放到桌上，随后缓步走到床边"}
{"time": 1764071012, "type": "recv", "message_id": "667563687", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "把两套衣服也放到桌边"}
{"time": 1764071037, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1688789302", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=667563687]然后再退出去"}
{"time": 1764071051, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1097665301", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=505479503]“舒茉？吃饭了，先喝点汤吧？”"}
{"time": 1764071115, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1207767210", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "裹在被子里，迷迷糊糊听到妈妈的声音，\"嗯...待会再吃吧...\"回答的声音带着没睡醒的倦意，\"再睡一会...\""}
{"time": 1764071339, "type": "recv", "message_id": "808565857", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这孩子……”她摇摇头，帮你把被子扯松一点，不至于热得冒汗，随后扭头开口“那伊恩……人呢？”"}
{"time": 1764071352, "type": "recv", "message_id": "82084520", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（小懒猪（）"}
{"time": 1764071378, "type": "recv", "message_id": "692751280", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "好像听到自己名字被提起“我在门口”"}
{"time": 1764071482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1526586246", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“来吃饭吧，也买了你的”"}
{"time": 1764071515, "type": "recv", "message_id": "467505231", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“oh，谢谢阿姨，我去把叔叔也叫过来吧”"}
{"time": 1764071556, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1262976305", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "回房间去叫汉斯“叔叔吃饭了”"}
{"time": 1764071625, "type": "recv", "message_id": "350739520", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（所以听到伊恩的声音是不是该醒一下）"}
{"time": 1764071661, "type": "recv", "message_id": "701747798", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（可能舒茉生气了，不想理我（）"}
{"time": 1764071691, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1201686610", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "被子扯松了之后透气明显好了一些，本来就有些清醒了，听到之后下意识先把自己最关心的问题问了出来，\"嗯...伊恩回来了?\""}
{"time": 1764071851, "type": "recv", "message_id": "813159041", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1201686610]“嗯。会一起吃饭”"}
{"time": 1764071948, "type": "recv", "message_id": "762511841", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "听起来没出什么事，但是自己...略微睁眼看了一眼，赶忙收回眼睛，之前一直在胡思乱想的触感再度浮现，\"...\"睡着之后好了些的脸红又浮了上来，\"我待会再吃...\"拿被子遮住半边脸"}
{"time": 1764071987, "type": "recv", "message_id": "462762939", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（感觉要如坐针毡了）"}
{"time": 1764072290, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1723951816", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好吧好吧……是不是生理期到了？”她也没过多在意，招呼着另外两个坐到桌边，一一打开饭盒。主食自然是荠菜猪肉馅的饺子，此外还买了一点炸虾和普罗旺斯烩菜。玉米排骨汤则清润甘美"}
{"time": 1764072354, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1129729304", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "舒茉不会生我的气了吧....感觉有点坐立不安，饭到嘴里都没什么味道"}
{"time": 1764072419, "type": "recv", "message_id": "873162301", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "大概……餐桌上只有你们三个人，这还是第一次"}
{"time": 1764072520, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1265801027", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "此刻自然是无心吃饭，但是就在自己旁边开餐，当然也睡不着，身子缩了缩，让被子遮住双眼，只露出额头在外面，绷着不动弹。"}
{"time": 1764072602, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1694482389", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“怎么了这是？”舒蕾察觉到气氛不太对劲，咽下一口饺子“闹矛盾了？怎么都躲起来了”"}
{"time": 1764072639, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1382326276", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没...没有吧...应该没有”"}
{"time": 1764072678, "type": "recv", "message_id": "246272356", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"声音从被子里传出来难免有些闷，\"没...只是有点热...\""}
{"time": 1764072769, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1549935265", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（热还躲被子里？）"}
{"time": 1764072786, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1775733597", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "随便吃了几口，也没什么继续吃下去的心情了“我吃饱了...刚刚在外面买了点东西吃了，不是很饿，用不用拿些吃的给莫辛母女她们两送过去....”"}
{"time": 1764072888, "type": "recv", "message_id": "966826856", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1382326276]（有无不知，那就是有）"}
{"time": 1764072940, "type": "recv", "message_id": "978788711", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"想了想才继续开口补充，\"只是身体不太舒服...伊恩没出事吧...\"当然指的是跳下去的事，发生的太快自己都没反应过来"}
{"time": 1764072982, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1210998847", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没事...我能有什么事...舒茉没事就好”"}
{"time": 1764072989, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1497132952", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1775733597]“我倒没买6个人的份，她们自己也会找商会帮忙的，不用那么操心”"}
{"time": 1764073029, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1123152503", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我..没什么事，这样啊...叔叔阿姨，我差不多饱了，先回去休息了”"}
{"time": 1764073175, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1234592251", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "至少明眼人都能看得出你们今天不太对劲"}
