{"time": 1764090164, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2010466775", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（哎，好吧）"}
{"time": 1764090235, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1915466580", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1934049953]“呃？有什么联系？”"}
{"time": 1764090308, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1085466310", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...当时伊恩用魔法逃下去了...还穿的是我的衣服...\"咬着牙，其实不想说...但是下意识觉得要和妈妈说"}
{"time": 1764090391, "type": "recv", "message_id": "154304621", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“什么叫穿着你的衣服……不对为什么要逃下去……？”舒蕾的眉头皱了起来"}
{"time": 1764090461, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2102024503", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（人生要结束了（）"}
{"time": 1764090602, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1776771115", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...因为当时在kiss...\"干脆全部说出来，\"...\""}
{"time": 1764090724, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1972650057", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不是，这不构成因果关系”舒蕾摇头，语气有些严肃"}
{"time": 1764091023, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1024836943", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“他到底想干什么？亲了你就跑了，是觉得自己错了，但是不想接受？”"}
{"time": 1764091089, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1502764203", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...不想被看见，舒茉也能理解吧...?\"歪着脑袋，觉得母亲有些小题大做。"}
{"time": 1764091282, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2121094929", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“然后留你一个人在这里解释？”"}
{"time": 1764091321, "type": "recv", "message_id": "498479796", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（跑的主要原因还是因为身上穿着女装（））"}
{"time": 1764091444, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1611561222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"主要他穿着女装吧？\"其实对这个感觉还好..."}
{"time": 1764091747, "type": "recv", "message_id": "202981040", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你……你是不是太向着他了”她的眉头皱的更深了“如果我不说，你和他打算瞒到什么时候？”"}
{"time": 1764092015, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1459145272", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"低下头，先等着妈妈开口"}
{"time": 1764092053, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1456236877", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（瞒着什么，女装的爱好吗（））"}
{"time": 1764092196, "type": "recv", "message_id": "569015871", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“还是说，你和他都觉得遮遮掩掩就好了？”"}
{"time": 1764092247, "type": "recv", "message_id": "314949486", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不是...不是...\"头埋得更低了，\"和妈妈说...就是不打算隐瞒...\""}
{"time": 1764092538, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1811869692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“说到底，你们到底是怎么看对方的？”"}
{"time": 1764093248, "type": "recv", "message_id": "282579591", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"咬了咬嘴唇，\"我喜欢他....\""}
{"time": 1764093389, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1180315942", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我知道，我也没反对过”舒蕾靠在椅背上，组织了一遍语言“为什么不敢光明正大的？是怕我知道了会做什么？”"}
{"time": 1764093429, "type": "recv", "message_id": "127541889", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（因为还没正式确定关系（）"}
